ne all’età adulta, alla scoperta dei rispettivi veri caratteri, in un’alternanza di comico e drammatico, di gioia e di dolore. E quando la realtà dura che li bracca spietata arriva a presentargli il conto, dovranno affrontarla, forti di una nuova consapevolezza e di un insperato coraggio."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Turning Point","overview":"A slacker who does his best to avoid confrontation strikes up an unlikely friendship with a dangerous thug who suddenly forces his way into his life."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2xN6wZ5bktZMig5IfSJftUomvFa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jVsMdZDGmWVkSAuAFOIfWnXiXzq.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":828588,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2xN6wZ5bktZMig5IfSJftUomvFa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2xN6wZ5bktZMig5IfSJftUomvFa.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2xN6wZ5bktZMig5IfSJftUomvFa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2xN6wZ5bktZMig5IfSJftUomvFa.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h96hjpOEfSuQwAhYzK4kxO53o0Z.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h96hjpOEfSuQwAhYzK4kxO53o0Z.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ge7URX8RFL4zAiJ76dprYqs3HEt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ge7URX8RFL4zAiJ76dprYqs3HEt.jpg","language":"en","width":960,"height":1440},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ge7URX8RFL4zAiJ76dprYqs3HEt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ge7URX8RFL4zAi